Inspection response
    Existing object identifier, class, methods and instance variables.
    Runtime record: host, process, worker, active calls, references, pulse timing, metrics.
    Retention record: root flag, sampled path, unavailable objects and interpretation note.
Call activity
    Identifier, chain, selector, target, executing-or-waiting state and start time.
MCP request and response
    Preserve JSON-RPC identifier and version, method/params or result/error.
MCP tool invocation and result
    Named tool with typed argument payload; text content with execution-error flag.
MCP initialization
    Proposed protocol version, capabilities and client implementation name/version.
